---
title: Waffle Syrup
author: Mary Arntson
category: Good Morning, Morning Glory!
cook time: 5 minutes
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@water{1%cup}
@white sugar{1%cup}
@brown sugar{1%cup}
@white karo syrup{1%cup}
@mapleine{1%tsp}

Boil 5 minutes and add 1 tsp mapleine. Serve hot or cold.
